<title>POLAND: ECHO ISSUES PLN 1.5 MLN CPS.</title>
<headline>ECHO ISSUES PLN 1.5 MLN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish developer Echo SA has issued 1.5 million zlotys of commercial paper, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Echo said it had signed an agreement on the issue with Raiffeisen Centrobank SA&gt;.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
